{"items":[{"item":{"id":"customer-references#arctic-wolf-reinvent2024","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"arctic-wolf-reinvent2024","dateCreated":"2025-05-02T15:49:22+0000","dateUpdated":"2025-05-02T16:09:30+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"Arctic Wolf’s vulnerability management team needed a faster way to investigate security incidents. By leveraging AWS Config and AWS CloudFormation, they built a solution that provides complete resource history—helping teams assess potential threats in seconds instead of days. With AWS Cloud Governance services like AWS Config, Arctic Wolf automates security workflows, reduces maintenance efforts, and maximizes development efficiency—empowering teams to respond to threats faster and more effectively.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/source-png_logos/Arctic-Wolf_Logo.614c1ed25dc461212e5ec5df75786a41776b3caa.png","displayLocation":"United States","customerNameLower":"arctic wolf\u0027s network","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Software \u0026 Internet","sortDate":"2025-04-09","headlineUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v\u003d_NvOAAe9x40\u0026did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Arctic Wolf\u0027s Network","publishedDate":"2025","enableShare":"1","headline":"Enhancing Security Investigations with AWS Config","contentType":"Customer Story"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#location#united-states","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"United States","description":"United States","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:08+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:34+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#software-internet","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Software \u0026 Internet","description":"Software \u0026 Internet","dateCreated":"2020-06-25T04:08:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:09+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#config","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Config","description":"AWS Config","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:26+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#security-identity-compliance","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Security, Identity, \u0026 Compliance","description":"Security, Identity, \u0026 Compliance","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:32:22+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-15T04:54:50+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#mgmt-govern","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Management \u0026 Governance","description":"Management \u0026 Governance","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:21+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:28+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#americas","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Americas","description":"Americas","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:01+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:29+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#security-identity-compliance","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Security, Identity, \u0026 Compliance","description":"Security, Identity, \u0026 Compliance","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:33+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:33+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#customer-story","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Customer Story","description":"Customer Story","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#cloudformation","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS CloudFormation","description":"AWS CloudFormation","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:01:55+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:22+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#namer","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"North America","description":"North America","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:03+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:34+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#video","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Video","description":"Video","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:11+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#capital-express-netred-es-2025","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"capital-express-netred-es-2025","dateCreated":"2025-02-20T20:30:30+0000","dateUpdated":"2025-03-06T23:48:44+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"\u003cp\u003eLa compa\u0026ntilde;\u0026iacute;a de servicios de factoring Capital Express quer\u0026iacute;a mejorar las evaluaciones de los clientes y hacer crecer su negocio, pero ten\u0026iacute;a un sistema obsoleto que dificultaba el acceso a los datos. La compa\u0026ntilde;\u0026iacute;a recurri\u0026oacute; al socio de AWS, NetRed, para migrar sus datos utilizando los servicios de Amazon Web Services (AWS). Gracias a la migraci\u0026oacute;n, Capital Express pudo crear Advance, una innovadora herramienta de gesti\u0026oacute;n financiera que ofrece un procesamiento de datos en tiempo real. La implementaci\u0026oacute;n de Advance redujo los costos operativos mensuales en un 94 por ciento. Tambi\u0026eacute;n disminuy\u0026oacute; el tiempo necesario para la inscripci\u0026oacute;n de clientes y las consultas de TI a solo cinco minutos. Estas mejoras han agilizado las operaciones y permiten una prestaci\u0026oacute;n de servicios m\u0026aacute;s r\u0026aacute;pida, lo que aumenta dr\u0026aacute;sticamente el potencial de crecimiento de Capital Express y ayuda a satisfacer las necesidades de los clientes con mayor rapidez.\u003c/p\u003e\n","featured":"0","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/Capital%20Express%20Logo%20200x70px.53db0b44c9b01b2a4966a2e27211ad98a79df25b.png","displayLocation":"Chile","footerInfoText":"2025","industry":"Financial Services","sortDate":"2025-02-20","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/es/solutions/case-studies/capital-express-netred/","customer-name":"Capital Express","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2025","contentType":"Case Study","headline":"Capital Express Reduce los Costos Operativos Mensuales en un 94% con NetRed y AWS"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#product#rds","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon RDS","description":"Amazon RDS","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:05:00+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:56+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#amplify","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Amplify","description":"AWS Amplify","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:01:21+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:15+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#sqs","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Simple Queue Service (SQS)","description":"Amazon Simple Queue Service (SQS)","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:05:36+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:33:02+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#ec2","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon EC2","description":"Amazon EC2","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:51+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:31+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#database-migration-service","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Database Migration Service (DMS)","description":"AWS Database Migration Service (DMS)","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:30+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:27+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#lambda","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Lambda","description":"AWS Lambda","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:04:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:46+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#spanish","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"Spanish","description":"Spanish","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:59+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:26+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#financial-services","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Financial Services","description":"Financial Services","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:42:19+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:03+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#vpc","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon VPC","description":"Amazon VPC","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:06:00+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:33:06+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#chile","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Chile","description":"Chile","dateCreated":"2020-07-02T22:30:55+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:32+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#latam","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Latin America","description":"Latin America","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:06+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:30+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#databases","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Databases","description":"Databases","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:14+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:27+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#cloudformation","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS CloudFormation","description":"AWS CloudFormation","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:01:55+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:22+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#case-study","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Case Study","description":"Case Study","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#capital-express-netred-2025","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"capital-express-netred-2025","dateCreated":"2025-02-19T22:12:07+0000","dateUpdated":"2025-03-06T23:47:05+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"\u003cp\u003eFactoring services company Capital Express wanted to improve client evaluations and grow its business, but it had an outdated system that made accessing data difficult. The company teamed up with AWS Partner NetRed to migrate its data using capabilities from Amazon Web Services (AWS). Migrating helped Capital Express create Advance, an innovative financial management tool that offers real-time data processing. Implementing Advance cut monthly operating costs by 94 percent. It also reduced the time needed for client enrollment and IT consultations to just five minutes. These improvements streamlined operations and enabled faster service delivery, dramatically increasing the growth potential of Capital Express and helping it meet customer needs faster.\u003c/p\u003e\n","featured":"0","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/Capital%20Express%20Logo%20200x70px.53db0b44c9b01b2a4966a2e27211ad98a79df25b.png","displayLocation":"Chile","footerInfoText":"2025","industry":"Financial Services","sortDate":"2025-02-19","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/capital-express-netred/","customer-name":"Capital Express","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2025","contentType":"Case Study","headline":"Capital Express Reduces Monthly Operating Costs by 94% with NetRed and AWS"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#databases","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Databases","description":"Databases","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:14+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:27+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#chile","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Chile","description":"Chile","dateCreated":"2020-07-02T22:30:55+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:32+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#vpc","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon VPC","description":"Amazon VPC","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:06:00+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:33:06+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#cloudformation","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS CloudFormation","description":"AWS CloudFormation","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:01:55+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:22+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#ec2","locale":"en_US","ta