anagement \u0026 Governance","description":"Management \u0026 Governance","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:21+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:28+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#customer-segment#smb","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#customer-segment","name":"Small and Midsize Business (SMB)","description":"Small and Midsize Business (SMB)","dateCreated":"2021-06-04T06:35:46+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:15+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#airnguru","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"airnguru","dateCreated":"2023-06-01T23:09:54+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-07-12T01:35:42+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"Airnguru, una empresa que se dedica a proveer soluciones y tecnología de inteligencia de precios para las líneas aéreas de todo el mundo empezó en AWS porque consideró que las tecnologías en nube son las más actualizadas para comenzar a agregar valor muy rápido al negocio.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/airnguru_logo%401x.96aeaae29d9b2d8a423b6066030b6a03a05370a4.png","displayLocation":"Chile","footerInfoText":"Fecha de publicación","industry":"Viajes","sortDate":"2020-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/es/solutions/case-studies/airnguru/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2020","customer-name":"Airnguru","contentType":"Historia del cliente","headline":"Tecnologia AWS ayuda Airnguru a trabajar con líneas aéreas de todo el mundo"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#travel","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Travel","description":"Travel","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:42:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:09+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#cloudformation","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS CloudFormation","description":"AWS CloudFormation","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:01:55+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:22+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#compute","loc