n.com/health/case-studies/. When the GCRP decided to add multilingual content to the CSDIR in 2023, the owners of this page only wanted to display the English content in our Directory. Because the Directory Cards component on their page uses an OR operator to pull in content from two tags, they would be unable to add a prefilter condition to look for only English content. This can only be done if the page is using an AND operator. Thus, this tag will be autoapplied to all content that meets the current prefilter conditions. At that point, the page owners can use the AND operator to display content with this tag and GLOBAL#language#english.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#bicevida","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"bicevida","dateCreated":"2023-06-01T23:09:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-06-08T04:07:35+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"Con casi 30 años de operación en Chile, Bice Vida es una compañía de seguros y servicios financieros personales y empresariales caracterizada por ofrecer tecnología de punta a sus clientes. Para esto, desarrolla aplicaciones dirigidas a optimizar permanentemente el servicio y la atención a sus asegurados.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/bicevida_logo%401x.f441eaeca02419ca8e3dad165309935db6d46606.png","displayLocation":"Chile","footerInfoText":"Fecha de publicación","industry":"Servicios financieros","sortDate":"2018-01-01","enableShare":"1","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/es/solutions/case-studies/bicevida/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","publishedDate":"2018","contentType":"Historia del cliente","customer-name":"Bicevida","headline":"Caso práctico de Bice Vida"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#customer-segment#enterprise","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#customer-segment","name":"Enterprise (ENT)","description":"Enterprise (ENT)"