-on-aws","dateCreated":"2019-08-09T18:47:14+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-07-19T03:05:03+0000","additionalFields":{"featured":"0","descriptionSummary":"Expedia provides travel-booking services across its flagship site Expedia.com and about 200 other travel-booking sites around the world. Using AWS, Expedia\u0027s developers have been able to innovate faster while saving the company millions of dollars.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/Expedia_Customer-Reference_Logo.27045ad031c48bd983a26a5befaf0f39e63ff619.png","displayLocation":"Americas","footerInfoText":"Published Date","description":"\u003cp\u003eBy using AWS, Expedia has become more resilient. Expedia\u0026rsquo;s developers have been able to innovate faster while saving the company millions of dollars. Expedia provides travel-booking services across its flagship site Expedia.com and about 200 other travel-booking sites around the world.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","industry":"Travel \u0026 Hospitality","sortDate":"2014-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/expedia/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Expedia Increases Agility and Resiliency by Going All In on AWS","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2014","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"Expedia Increases Agility and Resiliency by Going All In on AWS"}},"tags":[{"id":"customer-references#customer-segment#enterprise","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#customer-segment","name":"Enterprise","description":"Enterprise","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:39:40+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-05T01:27:39+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#global","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Global","description":"Global","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:28:59+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:29+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#networking-content-dev","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Networking \u0026 Content Delivery